== gemini folder
result: captured
exec: <cli>
arg: "-p"
arg: "[도구 안내] 터미널 명령(run_command)은 이 실행에서 막혀 있고, 한 번이라도 시도하면 답 전체가 실패해요. ls, cat, find 같은 명령도 쓰지 마세요. 폴더와 파일은 터미널 없이 파일 읽기 도구로 보세요. 파일은 만들거나 고칠 수 없어요. 웹 검색(search_web)은 쓸 수 있지만 웹 페이지 열기(read_url_content)는 막혀 있어요. 질문에 폴더나 파일이 필요 없으면 도구 없이 바로 답하세요.\n\nSay hi.\nIf native workspace read tools are unavailable because of managed policy, request data from the host instead of guessing.\nReturn ONLY JSON {\"workspace_reads\":[{\"path\":\"absolute linked file path\",\"start\":1,\"end\":5,\"images\":false}]} and wait.\nThe host reads only linked files and returns data. This does not grant tools or bypass managed policy.\nDo not request writes or commands through this protocol. Request only needed ranges. After receiving requested data, answer the original task normally; do not return an empty request list. For an explicitly exhaustive file review, request a whole file range together instead of one page per request.\nFor text and code files start/end are line numbers; for PDFs and slides they are pages. If a result has next_offset, it was cut there: request the same range again with \"offset\": next_offset for the rest.\nIf a result has read_failed, that one path was wrong: use its similar paths or list the folder, and request again."
arg: "--sandbox"
arg: "--print-timeout"
arg: "50s"
arg: "--mode"
arg: "plan"
arg: "--add-dir"
arg: "$TEST_HOME/run-conditions-root"
dir: $TEST_HOME/.ai-illuminati/rooms/<uuid>/stateless-<uuid>
group: false
